    arr = arr - ((arr & s55()) >> 1)

    # Second step: Apply a mask s33 to the array and add it to itself right-shifted by 2 bits ANDed with the same mask.
    arr = arr + ((arr >> 2) & s33())

    # Third step: Add to each element in the array its version right-shifted by 4 bits.
    arr = arr + (arr >> 4)

    # Fourth step: Apply a mask s0F to the array to keep only the lower 4 bits of each byte.
    arr = arr & s0F()

    return arr
